v3. steady_clock CPU wall time. Work cost = controlled busy-wait (synthetic). Trace formatting disabled in slices; files written after runs.
Slice time covers: boundary checks, completion processing, notice/event dispatch (incl. rejected delivery), commit, round promotion.
Host step time additionally covers bounded mailbox admission (<= admit_limit) and tick bookkeeping.
40 A slices are SAMPLED per case; afterwards leftover work is drained OUTSIDE measurement and event accounting is asserted.

